  "final_message": "交付包已完成：[澄川公开周报交付包.zip](/Users/mac/Documents/originone/agent-work-running/.local/business-live-20260909-v2/restricted-material/project/deliverables/chengchuan-public-delivery.zip)。\n\n包内共 4 个文件：\n\n- [交付说明](/Users/mac/Documents/originone/agent-work-running/.local/business-live-20260909-v2/restricted-material/project/deliverables/cc-delivery.md:1)\n- [已复核公开报告](/Users/mac/Documents/originone/agent-work-running/.local/business-live-20260909-v2/restricted-material/project/deliverables/chengchuan-public-report.md:1)\n- 公开批次统计\n- 公开日志发布说明\n\n交付说明已写明：\n\n- 可对外使用的结论与禁止扩展解释的边界。\n- 五类未核实事项：报告周期、指标定义、周二重试原因、周四延迟处置、处理生命周期与 SLA。\n- 资料发布方、运行负责人、报告维护者、独立复核者及转发责任人的后续职责。\n- 公开资料、制作方核验及[独立复核记录](/Users/mac/Documents/originone/agent-work-running/.local/business-live-20260909-v2/restricted-material/project/deliverables/cc-independent-review.md:1)的引用关系。\n\n逐条运行日志、核验 JSON 和复核回执未装入外发 ZIP，仅作为内部审计引用保留。最终校验结果：10 个引用全部可解析、敏感模式 0 命中、4 个压缩包成员与源文件逐字节一致、独立复核结论为通过且无需返工。\n\n交付包 SHA-256：`2d46994cf19f6314d3e81e583f7b10e0f2abe4a53f6cd7dda124f09b200c862e`。完整校验记录见 [cc-delivery-verification.json](/Users/mac/Documents/originone/agent-work-running/.local/business-live-20260909-v2/restricted-material/project/deliverables/cc-delivery-verification.json:1)。未执行外部发布或推送。",
